# A page that names checks this tree reports

Commits carry a `Signed-off-by` line. The `DCO sign-off` check refuses a pull
request whose commits do not.

Every pull request is also read by the `Pull request hygiene` check, which is a
job that runs steps of its own rather than one that hands the work elsewhere.

Both names above are job names in `.github/workflows/`, which is what a run
reports under and what a ruleset entry has to carry.
